      <h1 class="ed-title">Do You Need a Treadmill Mat?</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        Usually yes, and on carpet or an upstairs floor almost always. But a mat is a floor protector and a dust barrier first, and a noise fix only partly. Here is what it does, what it does not, and how to pick one.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
